---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const meta = {
  title: "Vocabulary · Hufu",
  description: "Download AI and internet word lists. Each includes a version, source and SHA-256 checksum.",
};
---

<Base locale="en" slug="dictionaries" title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <main id="main"><div class="page-content wrap"><div class="page-heading"><a class="back-link" href="/en/">Hufu home <span aria-hidden="true">/</span></a><h1>Tiger-Code vocabulary, ready on install.</h1><p>The official Tiger-Code vocabulary ships with Hufu. Word input mounts the tables that match the script mode; your own phrases live in huma_custom.</p></div><div class="resource-summary"><p><strong>5 tables · about 500k records</strong><span>Official Tiger-Code release 2026.08.15 · ships with the app</span></p><a class="button primary" href="#">Vocabulary notes <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><p class="resource-note">Tables are prebuilt into the installer; the input method never downloads vocabulary.</p><form class="resource-filters" role="search"><label for="resource-search">Find vocabulary</label><input id="resource-search" type="search" placeholder="Name or example, e.g. DeepSeek"><label class="sr-only" for="resource-category">Category</label><select id="resource-category"><option value="all">All</option><option value="builtin">Characters</option><option value="words">Words</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select></form><p class="filter-count" id="resource-count" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="resource-list"></div><p id="resources-empty" class="empty-message" hidden>No matching list. Try another name or category.</p><section class="prose source-note"><h2>Where the tables come from.</h2><p>The vocabulary comes from the official Tiger-Code release 2026.08.15 (syhily/dicts/huma) and is built with the installer. The three word tables are prebuilt, so switching modes never recompiles them.</p><p>The Tiger-Code tables are used under their official release terms; brand entries grant no trademark licence or endorsement.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/tree/main/dicts/huma">Tables · dicts/huma <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/tree/main/dicts/huma">虎码方案 · dicts/huma <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a></div></section></div></main>
</Base>
